<Layout title="Why 40% of Trades Quotes Lose Money (And How AI Fixes It) | PresciaIQ Insights"
  description="Quoting on gut feel destroys margins. How TradesmanIQ predicts job profitability before you commit your crew.">
  <div class="pt-32 pb-24 min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
